  "title": "WASSP: Make TLV type filterable again",
  "description": "The sub TLV type being added later as a FT_NONE with the same\nfilter abbreviation made it impossible to filter by TLV type.\nUse a unique filter abbreviation for the field. Also, add the\nsub type as a FT_UINT16 with a custom format (it's selected from\none of several tables, and possibly should be multiple hf infos)\ninstead of as a FT_NONE so that the sub types can also be filterable.",
